### 4. Admin Application (Car Wash Owner)
The Admin Dashboard will be simplified to manage a single unified queue instead of multiple tabs for different barbers.

#### [MODIFY] [src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Downloads/Kimi_Agent_Barbershop%20Queue%20SaaS%20PRD%20%281%29/lavageticket/src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx)
- Remove fetching and state management for `barbers`.
- Remove the "Tabs" UI that separated tickets by barber. Display a single unified list of all `waiting` and `serving` tickets.
- Simplify [handleNextCustomer](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Downloads/Kimi_Agent_Barbershop%20Queue%20SaaS%20PRD%20%281%29/lavageticket/src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx#440-453) to just process the next person in the station queue.
- Simplify [handleManualTicket](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Downloads/Kimi_Agent_Barbershop%20Queue%20SaaS%20PRD%20%281%29/lavageticket/src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx#399-439) to not require a barber selection.
- Update stats and Quick Links (remove Barber App link and TV link).

#### [MODIFY] [src/pages/AdminSettingsPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Downloads/Kimi_Agent_Barbershop%20Queue%20SaaS%20PRD%20%281%29/lavageticket/src/pages/AdminSettingsPage.tsx)
